# NOTE: cache/llm_cache.sqlite is deliberately NOT ignored.
# It is how reviewers reproduce headline numbers without an API key.

# src/embed.py content-hashes every embed() call, including tiny fixtures
# from the test suite - this stops that from polluting `git status` or
# ever being accidentally committed. The real corpus/eval-scale embeddings
# this project actually needs are already committed by filename below and
# are unaffected by this pattern (gitignore never un-tracks a tracked file).
data/interim/emb_*.npy
